        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Adam tarou zingmei rui kham ,",
            "Meiguai zai pat khang thou guangni cho?",
            "Kaniu lung geimei ti nchu khang,",
            "Kaniu paap zaeng thei khang,",
            "Tingkao laoziu na puan.",
            "",
            "Halleluijah neilana thuan ku o",
            "Kao guang jubilee ta,",
            "Bethlehem le kalvary ching ru khou,",
            "Kanloumei sien miu khuang.",
            "",
            "2. Salem bang khou misor namdai,",
            "Niuta kalloumei sien miu rui khuang.",
            "Nang niu khang rui tingkao laoziu na.",
            "Zeihaeng rui karuna,",
            "Houmu mei namdai khou.",
            "",
            "3. Thei thang houmu mei rih thao e,",
            "Pap rui nang bumaeng gumliam louna,",
            "Ziho- zeri chingru khou guang na,",
            "Hosanna sin guang na",
            "Salem chuangphei bang khou.",
            "",
            "4. Salem guang chuang bang khou ringmei,",
            "Salem Poubaomei rui suaihiem mei",
            "Ziho-zeri chingru khou bamguai meiguai",
            "Rui lai ngam puni e,",
            "Halleluiah Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
